/* The guide's content, in one place. build.mjs turns this and src/page.tpl into index.html.
 *
 * Inline markup inside any string: `code`, **bold**, {g:term|text} (glossary), {e:entity|text}, {f:flow|text},
 * {i:insight|text}, {p:problem|text}, {c:component|text}, [text](repo/relative/path) or [text](https://…).
 * Repo paths are written from the repository root; the build turns them into relative links.
 *
 * Rules for this file (see README.md in this folder): every fact comes from the repository; every number in an
 * insight is copied from its cited source; no hostnames, home paths or details of the held-out tests.
 */
