        text: ["The node runs `git pull --ff-only` on its checkout of main (a failed pull is recorded in the job but does not stop it), fetches the tags, and takes the newest `harness-v*` tag that is on `origin/main`. Newest means by the tag's name, date then that day's number, as numbers.", "With no release the job fails at once and says how to make one, unless the server was started with `--allow-unreleased`."],
